	"nodes":[
		{"id":"040334ae79913f74","type":"text","text":"**gateway**：本地服务 → 公网服务\n本质是：\n- reverse proxy\n- ingress\n- tunnel\n- edge layer\n\n你现在已经接触：\n\n- FRP\n- WireGuard\n- Sealos\nSealos（云端）\n运行：\n\n```\nfrps（server）nginxAPI gateway\n```","x":-330,"y":-220,"width":379,"height":460},
