		{"id":"e58a7a6de1f92f1c","type":"text","text":"**Worker**：Home Mac\n本质上是：\n- compute node\n- execution layer\n- runtime\n\n特点：\n\n```\n持续运行稳定高算力\n```\n运行：\n\n```\nfrpc（client）  \nAgent Runtime  \nDocker\n```","x":130,"y":-220,"width":370,"height":460},
